cards Boxes

box alice as Alice
box bob as Bob [mark: Payee]

item t1 as Ticket #1 in alice, bob [amount: 2 tickets, mark: bob]

step Line up
  say A box line places an owner column. Columns sit from left to right in the order written.

step Show a mark
  say A column's mark is the word it shows, and a card's mark picks the columns that show it.
  item t2 as Ticket #2 in bob [amount: 3 tickets]
